; Key tape for a net, sealed to each member, with handouts.
FORM NET_TAPE
TITLE Issue a key tape
SUMMARY Makes a key tape for a net (our own cipher), loads it here, and seals a copy to each member whose card you checked. Handouts go on a stick for members met in person.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 80
ACTION net_tape
FIELD net Net(X) required upper max=40
FIELD members Members(@stations+) required
FIELD keymasters Alternate keymasters(@cards+)
FIELD days Days(###) default=31 check=number
FIELD start First day(YYYYMMDD)
FIELD send Send the sealed tapes now(Y,N) default=Y
FIELD handouts Make handouts(Y,N) default=N
FIELD out Write handouts to(X) check=path
NEXT KEY_OPEN
BEGIN_HELP
Days:
How many daily keys. Over the air a sealed tape holds about two weeks; longer tapes go by handout on a stick.
END

Write handouts to:
A folder on a stick, such as /media/stick. Each member's handout is its own file.
END
